<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>brm5 higher recoil gun macro</Major>
    <Description>How TO USE MACRO
this macro allows you to minimize the recoil on the famas and most other higher recoil guns in blackhawk resuce mission 5. this allows you to focus on aim or use a higher fps without worrying about recoil.

(black hawk rescue mission 5 on roblox/brm5)




RESOLUTION: 1920x1080 60hz
FOV: default
ASPECT RATIO: 4:3
SENS: 17X 17Y 400 DPI</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 4 ms
MoveR 1 6
MoveR 0 5
MoveR 0 3
Delay 15
MoveR 0 1
MoveR 1 0
Delay 15
MoveR 0 2
MoveR 0 3
MoveR 0 2</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>